message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. If you use the PoL2 theory, please also cite the NaturalDAO source listed under references."
title: "The Third-Party Condition Test for Sycophancy"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
authors:
  - alias: "shentonyan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shentonyan/pol2-sycophancy-experiment"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A preregistered forced-choice experiment that operationalises the
  public-versus-exclusive-private contrast of PoL2 (Proof of Love2) as a
  measurable preference behaviour of language models. No experimental results
  are reported yet.
keywords:
  - sycophancy
  - language models
  - preregistration
  - PoL2
